					{p2␀␀␀5b␀␀2b␀␀/b␀␀,b␀␀)b␀␀&b␀␀#b␀␀ b␀␀b␀␀b␀␀b␀␀b␀␀b␀␀b␀␀b␀␀b␀␀b␀␀b␀␀ˇa␀␀¸a␀␀˘a␀␀ˆa␀␀Ûa␀␀a␀␀Ìa␀␀Ía␀␀Áa␀␀‰a␀␀·a␀␀ﬁa␀␀€a␀␀ÿa␀␀’a␀␀“a␀␀œa␀␀Ãa␀␀…a␀␀∆a␀␀√a␀␀¿a␀␀Ωa␀␀∫a␀␀∑a␀␀¥a␀␀±a␀␀Æa␀␀´a␀␀®a␀␀ôc␀␀ñc␀␀fxod(null)␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀8<␀␀␀␀␀␀8<␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀.c
	cc -c $(CFLAGS) -I$M -I. $M/trees.c
optim.o: $M/manifest macdefs $M/mfile1 $M/optim.c
